---
// src/components/About.astro
---
<section id="about" class="bg-[#F9F9F7] py-32 md:py-40 px-6 relative overflow-hidden">
  {/* Subtle sky-blue atmospheric detail */}
  <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-sky-200/20 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none translate-x-1/3 -translate-y-1/3" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-6xl relative z-10">
    <div class="mb-12 md:mb-20">
      <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ink-muted font-medium">
        About
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-24 items-start">
      {/* Left Column: Large Serif Heading */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-[4.5rem] text-ink leading-[1.05] tracking-tight">
          We craft digital spaces that feel as natural as breathing. Rooted in clarity, intention, and quiet elegance.
        </h2>
      </div>
      
      {/* Right Column: Readable Sans Paragraph */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 lg:pt-3">
        <p class="font-sans text-lg md:text-xl text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
          Our approach blends deep strategic thinking with meticulous visual execution. We believe the best design gets out of the way, allowing the underlying message to speak directly to the mind.
          <br/><br/>
          By stripping away the unnecessary, we create room for meaningful interaction, ensuring every touchpoint is purposeful and beautifully refined.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
